  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "EBBEB77C4A16B48B",
      "text": "Direi che qui va benone.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "EBBEB87C4A16B63E",
      "text": "Lascia che mi presenti di nuovo. Io sono\\nRupi, una Superquattro.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "EBBEB97C4A16B7F1",
      "text": "Non avrei mai pensato che qualcuno proveniente\\nda un’altra scuola avrebbe provato a scalare\\r\\nla classifica della Lega Mirtillo.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "EBBEBA7C4A16B9A4",
      "text": "Sono sinceramente sorpresa... ma non sono il tipo\\nche si lascia influenzare dai sentimenti.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "EBBEBB7C4A16BB57",
      "text": "Allora... La mia squadra è composta da\\nmolti Pokémon di tipo Folletto.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "EBBEBC7C4A16BD0A",
      "text": "Ho scelto questo tipo perché vado matta per i\\nPokémon rosa, carini e adorabili.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "EBBEBD7C4A16BEBD",
      "text": "Loro non se la cavano bene con cosine tossiche\\ne melmose, o metalliche...\\r\\nQuindi i tipi Veleno e Acciaio.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "EBBEAE7C4A16A540",
      "text": "Ah! Che sbadata, immagino che queste cose\\ntu le sappia già... Dico bene, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "EBBEAF7C4A16A6F3",
      "text": "Oggi ho intenzione di affrontarti tirando fuori\\ntutta la forza di cui sono capace.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "EBC23C7C4A19CC61",
      "text": "Voglio insegnarti una lezione importante,\\ndopotutto! E cioè che...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_11",
      "hash64": "EBC23B7C4A19CAAE",
      "text": "Essere graziosi non significa di certo essere\\ndeboli![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_12",
      "hash64": "EBC23A7C4A19C8FB",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]! [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_13",
      "hash64": "EBC2397C4A19C748",
      "text": "Hai visto i miei Pokémon? Sono o non sono\\ni più carini del mondo?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_14",
      "hash64": "EBC2407C4A19D32D",
      "text": "Adorabili... Meravigliosi... Eccezionali!![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_select_01",
      "hash64": "D00BCFCD2F27B3F8",
      "text": "Sì, erano tenerissimi!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_select_02",
      "hash64": "D00BD2CD2F27B911",
      "text": "Erano proprio forti!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_select_03",
      "hash64": "D00BD1CD2F27B75E",
      "text": "Eri carinissima pure tu!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_15",
      "hash64": "EBC23F7C4A19D17A",
      "text": "Uh uh uh! Vero?! Da qui posso vederli mentre\\nsi preparano a lottare, agitando il loro didietro\\r\\nin maniera così carina![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_16",
      "hash64": "EBC23E7C4A19CFC7",
      "text": "Bzzt! Risposta errata! Qui si parla di essere carini,\\nnon di forza! Chiaro?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_17",
      "hash64": "EBC23D7C4A19CE14",
      "text": "Bzzt! Risposta errata! Qui si parla di Pokémon,\\nnon di Allenatori! Chiaro?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_18",
      "hash64": "EBC2347C4A19BEC9",
      "text": "Però, sai che ti dico? Anche i tuoi Pokémon sono\\ndavvero adorabili, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_19",
      "hash64": "EBC2337C4A19BD16",
      "text": "Aaaah... È quasi un’ingiustizia tenerci per noi così\\ntanta graziosità, non trovi?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_20",
      "hash64": "EBC5C27C4A1CE5EA",
      "text": "Facciamoci una bella foto da condividere\\ncon tutti gli altri![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_21",
      "hash64": "EBC5C37C4A1CE79D",
      "text": "Ma... è venuta benissimo! È così carina che\\nla conserverò a vita nella mia raccolta...![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_22",
      "hash64": "EBC5C07C4A1CE284",
      "text": "Lascia che ti dia un premio, a riprova della tua\\nadorabile vittoria![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_23",
      "hash64": "EBC5C17C4A1CE437",
      "text": "Ho lottato con tutte le mie forze, eppure non\\nsono comunque riuscita a batterti.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_24",
      "hash64": "EBC5BE7C4A1CDF1E",
      "text": "Sono proprio curiosa di scoprire fin dove\\nti spingerai in questa scuola.\\r\\nHai tutti i nostri occhi puntati addosso![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_clerk_npc",
      "hash64": "6303353446E64743",
      "text": "Complimenti per aver sconfitto la Superquattro\\nRupi!",
      "flags": 0,
